{"recordId":"emperor_吳王闔閭_276868648","name":"吳王闔閭","type":"emperor","dynasty":"春秋","title":"破楚霸王","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"阖闾","pageId":7538,"revisionId":93508806,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-07-17T00:30:13Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%98%96%E9%97%BE","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93508806","wikidataId":"Q1279924","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"史记索隐·吴太伯世家","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"春秋左传正义·昭公二十七年","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"世本","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"春秋公羊传·襄公二十九年","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"左传·襄公三十一年","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"春秋左传注·襄公三十一年","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"左傳‧昭公二十七年","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"史記索隱","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"左傳‧定公四年","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"史記·吴太伯世家","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"左传·定公六年","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"吴王光鉴","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"吴越春秋","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:36:03.250Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:shiji","source:hanshu","source:houhanshu","source:zhanguoce"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:shiji-51ca88a2f253803e","query":"吳王闔閭","count":1,"offset":6062,"excerpt":"誅建，建亡；伍子胥奔吳。晉公室卑而六卿彊，欲內相攻，是以久秦晉不相攻。三十一年，吳王闔閭與伍子胥伐楚，楚王亡奔隨，吳遂入郢。楚大夫申包胥來告急，七日不食，日夜哭泣。於是秦乃發五百乘救楚，敗吳師。吳師歸，楚昭王乃得復入郢。哀公立三十六年卒。太子夷公，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:shiji-d54fa29aa542d849","query":"吳王闔閭","count":1,"offset":7473,"excerpt":"口乎？」是時景公好治宮室，聚狗馬，奢侈，厚賦重刑，故晏子以此諫之。\n\n四十二年，吳王闔閭伐楚，入郢。\n\n四十七年，魯陽虎攻其君，不勝，奔齊，請齊伐魯。鮑子諫景公，乃囚陽虎。陽虎得亡，奔晉。\n\n四十八年，與魯定公好會夾谷。犁鉏曰：「孔丘知禮而怯，請令","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:shiji-152e73b5b22da740","query":"吳王闔閭","count":1,"offset":1753,"excerpt":"之功德，乃長衛。夏，為晉滅沈，楚怒，攻蔡。蔡昭侯使其子為質於吳，以共伐楚。冬，與吳王闔閭遂破楚入郢。蔡怨子常，子常恐，奔鄭。十四年，吳去而楚昭王復國。十六年，楚令尹為其民泣以謀蔡，蔡昭侯懼。二十六年，孔子如蔡。楚昭王伐蔡，蔡恐，告急於吳。吳為蔡遠，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:shiji-4b357b1779444472","query":"吳王闔閭","count":1,"offset":1972,"excerpt":"空籍五歲矣。\n\n十年，陳火。十五年，吳王僚使公子光伐陳，取胡、沈而去。二十八年，吳王闔閭與子胥敗楚入郢。是年，惠公卒，子懷公柳立。\n\n懷公元年，吳破楚，在郢，召陳侯。陳侯欲往，大夫曰：「吳新得意；楚王雖亡，與陳有故，不可倍。」懷公乃以疾謝吳。四年，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:hanshu-1f8fc622331f449d","query":"吳王闔閭","count":1,"offset":7716,"excerpt":"不如速朽。」秦相呂不韋集知略之士而造春秋，亦言薄葬之義，皆明於事情者也。\n\n逮至吳王闔閭，違禮厚葬，十有餘年，越人發之。及秦惠文、武、昭、嚴襄五王，皆大作丘隴，多其瘞臧，咸盡發掘暴露，甚足悲也。秦始皇帝葬於驪山之阿，下錮三泉，上崇山墳，其高五十餘丈","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:hanshu-703e7b4ce1bf5dcf","query":"吳王闔閭","count":1,"offset":11279,"excerpt":"子，豈足爲大王道哉！〔應劭曰：「荊軻爲燕刺秦始皇，不成而死，其族坐之。湛，沒也。吳王闔閭欲殺王子慶忌，要離詐以罪亡，令吳王燔其妻子。要離走見慶忌，以劔刺之。」張晏曰：「七族，上至曾祖，下至曾孫。」師古曰：「此說云湛七族，無荊字也。尋諸史籍，荊軻無湛","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:houhanshu-cce437c583f8e3ef","query":"吳王闔閭","count":1,"offset":9869,"excerpt":"益。反水不收，後悔無及。〔言早當即尊位以定衆心，今執謙退，失於事機也。孫子名武，吳王闔閭將，善用兵，有兵法十三篇。反音翻。〕大王雖執謙退，柰宗廟社稷何！冝且還薊即尊位，乃議征伐。今此誰賊而馳騖擊之乎？」〔誰謂未有主也。《前書音義》曰：「直騁曰馳，亂","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:houhanshu-16020cbb8023939b","query":"吳王闔閭","count":1,"offset":8192,"excerpt":"棲吳王姑蘇之山也。\n\n注[一五]伍子胥名員，楚人也。子胥父誅於楚，子胥挾弓矢而干吳王闔閭，闔閭甚勇之，為興師伐楚，戰於柏舉，楚師敗績。事見谷梁傳。\n\n注[一六]史記曰，魯仲連，齊人也。燕將攻下齊聊城，固保守之，田單攻之不下。魯仲連乃為書遺燕將。燕將","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zhanguoce-0feb4075fdc7b56e","query":"吳王闔閭","count":1,"offset":13421,"excerpt":"，見韓策及刺客傳。〕也，白虹貫日；要離之刺慶忌也，〔鮑本吳越春秋，「要離，吳人。吳王闔閭欲殺王子慶忌，要離詐以罪亡，令吳王焚其妻子，走見慶忌，以劍刺之」。〕倉〔鮑本補曰：倉，即蒼。〕鷹擊於殿上。此三子者，〔鮑本無「者」字。○　札記丕烈案：說苑無。〕","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":9,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:shiji-51ca88a2f253803e","bookId":"book:shiji","requestedTitle":"史記/卷005","title":"史記/卷005","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8F%B2%E8%A8%98%2F%E5%8D%B7005","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=8744286","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8F%B2%E8%A8%98%2F%E5%8D%B7005?action=history","revisionId":8744286,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-08-31T06:59:56Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:34:02.348Z","sha256":"e0f3c7217c00827745a36cd9f9e550affc87b5bb618373109ad88d830da95cf0","textSha256":"eeb5fd997cd97ecd437ecb055eff330a19c60dfaa7a035c35adefba09bf4f614","expandedWikitextSha256":"e0f3c7217c00827745a36cd9f9e550affc87b5bb618373109ad88d830da95cf0","characters":10829,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/shiji.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:35.054Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleten